==Battleground==
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns as the boss after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Focus on Cat Combos for attack and use the other slots for the best killer for each type, like [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Elemental Duelist Cat]], [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]], [[Crazed Moneko (Special Cat)|Corrupted Moneko]] and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapsticks]]; it may be hard to deal with Oldhorn, but after he dies, the stage becomes a cakewalk.

[[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] does well for 3/4ths of the One Horn variants, especially against Oldhorn since it's a very tanky unit and will take a long time to kill. The spam and KB together with the higher range is enough to make it a usable meatshield here. In addition, [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman Cat Jobs]] is an excellent unit to protect your units.

